      "type": "text",
      "title": "我想要",
      "content": "想要什么东西，可以说 I want some water. 意思是“我想要一些水”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "words",
      "items": [
        { "text": "want", "meaning": "想要" },
        { "text": "water", "meaning": "水" },
        { "text": "bread", "meaning": "面包" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "小提示",
      "content": "some 表示“一些”，后面可以接 water、bread 这样的词。"
    }
  ],
